# NJB (新改訳2017): checked against the text on bible.com, Sept 2026.
# Psalm 47 has 10 verses and an unnumbered title, so its count is Hebrew but
# its numbering English: 47:1 is "O clap your hands", and 47:9-10 split
# English 47:9 ("The princes of the people are gathered together" / "for the
# shields of the earth belong unto God"), which is Hebrew 47:10.
PSA 47:1-8 = PSA 47:2-9
PSA 47:9 = PSA 47:10
PSA 47:10 = PSA 47:10
